    {
      "text": "Fig 11, 'Health supply chain end-to-end visibility and traceability'. Product flows from manufacturing and shipping through customs, central warehouse receiving and inventory management, distribution, regional warehouse replenishment and health facility dispensing to individuals, with forecasting and planning, supplier and contract management, procurement and order management above. Arcs mark end-to-end visibility at country and global level, and arrows below mark track and trace at national and global level.",
